        "locator": "{\"end_char\": 950785, \"end_line\": 16110, \"offset_unit\": \"UNICODE_CODE_POINTS\", \"pdf_file\": null, \"pdf_reference_base\": \"LANE_ROOT\", \"printed_page\": null, \"scan_indexes_0_based\": [], \"span_semantics\": \"EXACT_QUOTE\", \"start_char\": 950466, \"start_line\": 16107}",
        "exact_excerpt": "W  HEN  you  quit  the  narrow  and  fandy  fliore,  which  is  below  the  village \nof  Argent i era^  in  order  to  repair  to  \"the  Ifland  of  Milo,  iituated  to \nthe  fouth,  you  enter  into  a  confined  channel,  between  the  Iflets  of  San \nGiorgio  and  Sant  Eustachio  and  the  Ifland  of  Argentiera.",
